pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Goodwill and acquired intangible assets are measured at fair value on a non-recurring basis when an impairment is recognized. The Group measures goodwill at fair value annually or whenever events or changes in circumstances indicate that the carrying amount of a reporting unit exceeds its fair value. The fair value of goodwill is determined using discounted cash flows, and an impairment loss is recognized for any excess in the carrying value of goodwill over the implied fair value of goodwill. The Group measures acquired intangible assets using the income approach&#8212;discounted cash flow method, when events or changes in circumstances indicate that the carrying amount of an asset may no longer be recoverable. During the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, the Group recorded US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_EFQFtHz-pUaFz3EWj1MDRQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill" scale="3" id="Narr_8joKIt8GAkGD9dGIIDGw2Q">1,135</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_NLOWLiFbU0-sJlXr-1cTYw" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill" scale="3" id="Narr_LCVioVq-_kK3Zg2_cspiOQ">nil</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_NcsE5lIKA063hSMp34loJg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill" scale="3" id="Narr_u3cvFen3z0O7sP848tRp2g">nil</ix:nonFraction> impairment <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_TRfYrpDhtEijS_dSWs7_Rg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">loss</span></span> for intangible as