imal" name="us-gaap:ProfitLoss" scale="6" id="Narr__8zLTbh9UEeH0hiwvV-gFA">2</ix:nonFraction> million of profits earned by HK entity will be taxed at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Ux3XuayuEUyYfnn5KYYciw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_InlandRevenueHongKongMember_YlWKNolvnESMYBwzx816lQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_fXdc-ubjh0qz0VxLDC1b_Q">8.25</ix:nonFraction>%, while the remaining profits will continue to be taxed at the existing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Ux3XuayuEUyYfnn5KYYciw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_InlandRevenueHongKongMember_4PEHdCCQFUWwVzHW6qnWjA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZougAVizpEeQtnkX3QSYRA">16.5</ix:nonFraction>% tax rate. In addition, to avoid abuse of the two-tiered income tax rate regime, each group of connected entities can nominate only <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_jgpUgnBoQUy9ZUfMIx6i7Q" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_InlandRevenueHongKongMember_5mm0ehh_r0izLkinDkYOBA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="zepp:NumberOfNominators" scale="0" id="Narr_qD_G3uglkE2pbK85sT-obw">one</ix:nonFraction> entity to benefit from the two-tiered income tax rate. Additionally, payments of dividends by the subsidiaries incorporated in HK to the Company are not subject to any HK withholding tax. Under the HK tax laws, the Company is exempted from the HK income tax on foreign-derived income.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s subsidiaries Zepp Inc and Zepp NA are located in the U.S. and are subject to an income tax rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Ux3XuayuEUyYfnn5KYYciw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_InternalRevenueServiceIRSMember_IWf_QOi_i0iahdrk2sAlmA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_zW-Zf3nG6kWa_ua8SkhRDA">21</ix:nonFraction>% for taxable income earned as determined in accordance with relevant tax rules and regulations in the U.S.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s subsidiaries Zepp Europe and Zepp Netherlands are located in Netherlands and subject to an income tax rate for taxable income earned as determined in accordance with relevant tax rules and regulations in Netherlands. The first &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_hiu676q0iUOZXgA5WnJxzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_TaxAndCustomsAdministrationNetherlandsMember_DOVi0pv-eUuy5iLi7Jqq6w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zepp:ThresholdAmountForLowerTaxRate" scale="6" id="Narr_pVWFdFk7yEmbbXMqLVuq3A">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million (approximately US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_TaxAndCustomsAdministrationNetherlandsMember_DOVi0pv-eUuy5iLi7Jqq6w" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zepp:ThresholdAmountForLowerTaxRate" scale="6" id="Narr_1B1m85YqR0KaQBW7cGeLFA">0.19</ix:nonFraction> million) of profits earned will be taxed at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Ux3XuayuEUyYfnn5KYYciw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_TaxA