le="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.36%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.57%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_Y7qLeFlWiUGVtOQXX5h5aA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsNet" scale="3" id="Tc_b8WMwWedRUSBGSUHJds7HQ_11_2">17,465</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.42%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.56%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_aJSg9TSqmk6HCT3BzPR5iQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsNet" scale="3" id="Tc_9ncdFyLQmU2dSD6hXD-JrQ_11_4">15,743</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Net operation losses and tax credit carry-forwards</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, the Group had US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_zepp_PeopleOfRepublicChinaHongKongUnitedStatesAndCanadaMember_2-ngVcCwEESo2qjywRkbyQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" scale="3" id="Narr_86K8b6hvBk2vRN91Nr2__w">311,421</ix:nonFraction> operating losses deriving from entities in the PRC, HK, U.S., Canada, and etc. The operating losses in the PRC amounted to US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_StateAdministrationOfTaxationChinaMember_hP2WUtHwcEuTEasZkJgMCQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" scale="3" id="Narr_6Do7eSdQBUuMJY-U3H9lew">179,831</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025 and can be carried forward for five years, or ten years if the Group qualifies as HNTE. Some operating losses, if not utilized, will begin to expire in 2026. The operating losses in the U.S. amounted to US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_US_pfe5xKmUkUWupR1DJiBQ9Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="3" id="Narr_OuBFpMLbwk6na24D7rQI0Q">3,538</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025, in which if the loss incurred before December 31, 2017, it can be carried forward for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2017_To_12_31_2017_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_InternalRevenueServiceIRSMember_yhrBXpqtkkqU_7FMpErUhw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="zepp:OperatingLossCarryForwardsCarryForwardPeriod" id="Narr_JSwatqUUxUex4RMC7SbgQg">20 years</ix:nonNumeric> to offset future taxable profit, while if the losses incurred after December 31, 2017, it may be carried forward indefinitely. The operating losses in the HK amounted to US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_HK_B64gBG5SsU-8qa39c0JcsA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="3" id="Narr_UTzZ1OdQ0ESYGHUJUV9lFA">6,062</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025 and can be carried forward indefinitely. The operating loss incurred in the Canada amounted to US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_stpr_CA_yhwTp7UGkk6_sk8FGIB6Ow" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="3" id="Narr_MswNit8Tzk-Else0M46gYQ">7,981</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025 and can be carried back <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_CanadaRevenueAgencyMember_PiLcbGmWSUSweuMqC3AkbA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="zepp:OperatingLossCarryForwardsCarryForwardPeriod" id="Narr_HL7lLqwYukmMpgDzb94twA">3 years</ix:nonNumeric> and forward <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis_us-gaap_CanadaRevenueAgencyMember_ZWA1O9SzikaJRDYVXnJU8g" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="zepp:OperatingLossCarryForwardsCarryForwardPeriod" id="Narr_OPJkHcDQXEimieORzXqYPQ">20 years</ix:nonNumeric> for deduction against any form of income.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Management assesses the available positive and negative evidence in certain entities in the PRC, HK, U.S. and Canada to estimate if sufficient future taxable income will be generated to utilize the existing deferred tax assets and determines the valuation allowance on an entity by entity basis. In making such determination, the Group considers the following factors, among other matters, when determining whether some portion or all of the deferred tax assets will more likely than not be realized: the nature, frequency and severity of recent losses, forecasts of future profitability, the duration of statutory carry-forward periods, the Group&#8217;s experience with tax attributes expiring unused and tax planning alternatives. The Group&#8217;s ability to realize deferred tax assets depends on its ability to generate sufficient taxable income within the carry-forward periods provided for in the tax law. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="text-transform:uppercase;">F-</span><span style="text-transform:uppercase;">36</span></p></div></div>
