mpany adopted the 2018 share incentive plan (&#8220;2018 Plan&#8221;), commencing on January&#160;1, 2018, which provides additional incentives to employees, directors and consultants to promote the success of the Group&#8217;s business. Under the 2018 share incentive plan, the maximum aggregate number of shares which may be issued initially pursuant to all awards under the 2018 Plan is <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_dV4fjkklBESCyM__ND0mnw" contextRef="As_Of_1_1_2018_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zepp_EquityIncentivePlanTwoThousandEighteenMember_qpr8dCQASESxggU5ViTZ4w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_4KyHO6NvcEGLg61Q_hMC0w">9,559,607</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares. The number of shares reserved for future issuances under the 2018 Plan will be increased by (i)&#160;a number equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Ux3XuayuEUyYfnn5KYYciw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2018_To_1_1_2018_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zepp_EquityIncentivePlanTwoThousandEighteenMember_uGbLq57qoEu8YNYkMPQibg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zepp:PercentageOfOutstandingNumberOfShares" scale="-2" id="Narr_uNCOh2y21UisHii8nSBPIg">1.0</ix:nonFraction>% of the total number of outstanding shares immediately after IPO, or (ii)&#160;such number of shares as may be determined by the board of directors, on the first day of each calendar&#160;year during the term under 2018 Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">2023 Share Incentive Plan</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company adopted the 2023 Share Incentive Plan (&#8220;20