ed" scale="3" id="Narr_jRcJxAz93EKGFpOgynDQ2w">nil</ix:nonFraction> statutory reserve from the new appropriable profit earned by certain PRC entities in the Group.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">As a result of these PRC laws and regulations, the Group&#8217;s PRC subsidiaries are restricted in their ability to transfer a portion of their net assets to the Company either in the form of dividends, loans or advances. The balances of restricted net assets were US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_yj4vx6pAZ0uZ-7uXSsJGqw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmountOfRestrictedNetAssetsForConsolidatedAndUnconsolidatedSubsidiaries" scale="3" id="Narr_li8mHmiuXEOezsWt3D2p4A">48,920</ix:nonFraction>, US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_Y7qLeFlWiUGVtOQXX5h5aA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmountOfRestrictedNetAssetsForConsolidatedAndUnconsolidatedSubsidiaries" scale="3" id="Narr_Z_akJ_IvuUWwYrlShHf8Jw">49,824</ix:nonFraction> and US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_GqnV0h8vo0efDIhRtRNQ5w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_aJSg9TSqmk6HCT3BzPR5iQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmountOfRestrictedNetAssetsForConsolidatedAndUnconsolidatedSubsidiaries" scale="3" id="Narr_jmGCOQufIkKfvpsW6I_Cxw">56,590</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_NcsE5lIKA063hSMp34loJg" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_3MBmBMk39EGpsSSjsFP7Dw" continuedAt="Tb_3MBmBMk39EGpsSSjsFP7Dw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','